# The canonical shared files. The copy of record is ai-agent-template main;
# these are copies and must stay byte-identical, which
# scripts/check_template_drift.py enforces in .github/workflows/docs.yml.
# Prettier rewrites three of them - the stylesheet most heavily - so formatting
# them here would break that parity silently, on the next unrelated
# `prettier --write`. The Python files are listed too: Prettier does not format
# Python today, and the list is the record of what must not be touched rather
# than a list of what Prettier would reach.
# See #1321, #1329 and #1335.
docs/assets/stylesheets/liferay-blue.css
scripts/mkdocs_github_alerts.py
scripts/check_docs_rendered.py
scripts/check_template_drift.py
overrides/main.html
overrides/partials/copyright.html

# The shared skill is a copy too, governed by the same drift checker (it sits
# under .agents/skills/, which is in the default governed set even though the
# docs CI job compares only --docs-site). Prettier rewrites its tables and
# wrapping, which would read as drift the next time the full check is run.
.agents/skills/docs-site-standard/SKILL.md
